with its casein generates 70% fewer emissions and uses 99% less water than =
conventional dairy milk.

=F0=9F=9A=80  The outlook: While the company awaits regulatory approval, it=
=E2=80=99s shifted (https://agfundernews.com/the-next-frontier-for-animal-f=
ree-dairy-slow-release-mineral-delivery-says-eden-brew?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8CC=
