ein as an ingredient for supplements, food fortification, and sports nutrit=
ion. Thanks to casein micelles, Eden Brew is able to load up its proteins w=
ith iron, zinc, and magnesium for a slow-release drip of nutrients =E2=80=
=94 something that will be increasingly marketable as GLP-1 drug use skyroc=
kets.

