year through Dec. 11, according to FactSet via (https://www.wsj.com/article=
s/companies-are-desperately-seeking-storytellers-7b79f54e?mod=3Dbusiness_fe=
at9_media_pos2&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-8CCe_HbEFhPH0xl9MX4f1gBAhot1gO1jqmtj7Fwzmfl=
