all Street Journal. That=E2=80=99s up from 359x last year and 147x in 2015.=
 Meanwhile, the number of LinkedIn job postings that mention =E2=80=9Cstory=
teller=E2=80=9D have also doubled since last year. So, who are these in-dem=
and professionals?

Likely people who prefer the title =E2=80=9Cdigital content creator=E2=80=
=9D to =E2=80=9Cjournalist.=E2=80=9D The uptick represents a shift in corpo=
rate strategies away from earned media =E2=80=94 publicity acquired through=
 journalists and traditional news outlets =E2=80=94 and toward self-publish=
