m02-ZW0W50kgx26lZ3lWW7TmG-J8Ckg5qW5zQCKX4M6hcVW83GGvF5w6vxhMYx2x_JPpf6W3Bb7=
KC4PhPmzW3-DZp113-kdLW2DjW2L1XDNNyW1rCrGL4xGhcHW3CPkdy5CRMRqW4-T59b5HyWqWW8=
tPv2D5TZpCzW4cG5KP5j7gTbW7vBPLS18BBx2W5FHlsC1CqzGfW5nB_Nc2WNKx3W7X4qV-6GvmH=
pf7YnmVb04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v=
2=3D"Wby2tgKQ" target=3D"_blank">Sprouty</a> recently closed a $550k seed r=
ound. It offers AI-backed support for key parenting elements =E2=80=94 from=
 weight tracking to figuring out why your baby is crying (with 80% accuracy=
, allegedly).&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And Sprouty is just one app in a growing mark=
et, with many focused on older kids:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
