n 2024.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The sector is blowing up, but these baby care=
 apps raise a few eyebrows =E2=80=94 a big question being, "Do they allevia=
te or compound the anxiety they profit from?"</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">An anxious =
bunch&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">Millennial parents deal with a lot =E2=80=94 =
even beyond the conventional troubles that come with keeping a tiny, fragil=
e, easily scarred-for-life human being alive.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">A recent <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com=
/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVRH051JCw-qW3vQvk674V0TxW1MKd8X5H92G9MJvQmW2-ZW0W=
6N1vHY6lZ3mbW8VNkLM2JJSPxW5wXnJ5520BSBW8d6pqw8qwJkzW10Mt7M6lZYlbW3DnnqV7xsX=
