t9q04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=3D"=
hi/5sqDG" target=3D"_blank">report</a> from the Ann &amp; Robert H. Lurie C=
hildren=E2=80=99s Hospital of Chicago found:</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">46% feel burned out.&nbsp;<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">58% say they struggle to balance their work and home l=
ife<br><br></li>
<li aria-level=3D"1">85% believe social media creates unrealistic parenting=
 expectations</li>
</ul>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">And while a lot of parents are clearly feelin=
g anxious, it remains to be seen whether or not technology is the solution.=
&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">It is, however, if you ask OpenAI CEO and new=
 dad Sam Altman, who <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2=
q-Vf04/VVRH051JCw-qW3vQvk674V0TxW1MKd8X5H92G9MJvQnb2-ZW0W7lCdLW6lZ3lKN3VLQT=
9_v2nvW1g8fXk90sy5JW2-1hmR4yCC7LW4SFHyV45W5rnW5PfX-m320Q4fW7_-7Fy4VrcwKW9g3=
