krbWC04" style=3D"color:#192733" data-hs-link-id=3D"0" data-hs-link-id-v2=
=3D"+d24mQ2U" target=3D"_blank">said</a> he can=E2=80=99t imagine raising a=
 newborn without ChatGPT.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><br>Special shoutout to <a href=3D"https://me=
dia.hubspot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VVRH051JCw-qW3vQvk674V0TxW1MKd8X5H9=
